  "hero_summary_zh": "只要噬魂鬼接近了他的猎物，他连一线生机都不会给予。他可以在友方英雄和小兵体内潜伏，接近敌人时他从宿主体内爆发而出，用利爪将大惊失色的敌人撕碎。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Should Lifestealer get close to his prey, there is little that can save them. Travelling within a creep or an allied hero, once he nears a foe he explodes from his host body, surprising enemies and tearing into them with his claws.",
